# Pre-push checks

Before any `git commit` or `git push` requested by the user:

1. Run `bun run build` (or `npm run build`) and fix every TypeScript/build error.
2. Run `bun run lint` when practical; fix errors introduced by the current change. Pre-existing lint debt may be left alone unless it blocks CI.
3. Run the project test script if one exists (`bun test` / `npm test`); this repo currently has no unit-test script.
4. Do not push until the build succeeds.

Do not skip these checks for “small” or “typing-only” fixes.
